ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:

  Winter gave way to sweet spring, and Severtari prepared to carry out his 
imperial assignments.  He prepared his forces to defend Crete and the 
surrounding provinces.

  Thus endeth the adventures of Severtari Son of Anubi for this year.



  Here is the financial report for Severtari's kingdom: this turn, the 
Kingdom collected 0 gold in revenue.  0 gold was expended to finance our 
leaders.  0 gold was expended to maintain our armies.  Severtari was left 
with 6 gold in the treasury.


LETTER REPORTS

  O King of Kings, thy heroes have travelled around the globe in
search of adventure and conquest.  I have faithfully kept their
correspondence, and now I present it to thee:


