IMPERIAL OFFICE REPORT

  Into thy heroic dreams cometh an apparition heaven-sent, to speak to thee of
thy progress in thy ambitions for Imperial Office.  It is not for mortal Kings
to know who rivals them for high offices, but the Divine One will allow you to
know thy place in the standings, and how thee compares to thy fiercest foreign
rival for each office (shown under "Riv%" as a percentage: your points divided
by your rival's points, times 100.)

Imperial Office           Best Hope     Rank  Riv%   Second Hope   Rank  Riv%
World Emperor             Severtari       21    27   None
Esteemed High Chancellor  Accolon         16    42   Pascal          16    42
Imperial Treasurer        Severtari       10    13   None
Imperial Grand Marshal    Accolon         27     0   Pascal          27     0
Imperial Grand Admiral    Severtari        4    50   Pascal          24    16
Lord High Defender        Accolon          4     0   Pascal           4     0
High Priest Palatine      Pascal          10    50   Severtari       10    50
Arch-Mage Palatine        Severtari        7    60   Pascal          40    20
Silver Tongue             Severtari        1   300   None
  The title of "The Silver Tongue" is reserved for the world's smoothest 
diplomat.  The title is worth 2 prize percentage points on the Imperial 
Office Table.
  As the Silver Tongue, Severtari has won renown as the world's smoothest 
talker and ablest diplomat.  His reputation is such that even the monsters 
in their lairs have heard of Severtari.  They will never respond violently 
when talked to, and will always honor any agreement made with Severtari when 
he fulfills his end of it.


  The Druidic alignment now controls 4% of the world's votes
(taxbase + (5 X office/treasure points)).     


